<title>JAPAN: Japan 6-year bond auction lowest price at 100.20.</title>
<headline>Japan 6-year bond auction lowest price at 100.20.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance said its auction of 500 billion yen worth of six-year bonds on Tuesday produced the following results:</p>
<p>Lowest price	 100.20    Stop rate	   1.962 pct</p>
<p>Average price	100.21    Average yield     1.959 pct</p>
<p>Total bids	   1.802 trillion yen</p>
<p>Accepted Bids	498.5 billion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 74.1249 pct</p>
<p>Issue date    Nov 20, 1996   Maturity    Nov 20, 2002</p>
